<!-- =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D CONCEPTS =
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D -->
<section id=3D"concepts">
  <div class=3D"fade-in visible">
    <div class=3D"section-label">01 =C2=B7 Fundamentals</div>
    <h2 class=3D"section-title">What is a<br>Trace Table?</h2>
    <p class=3D"section-desc">A trace table is a technique used to track th=
e values of variables during the execution of an algorithm, one line at a t=
ime.</p>

    <div class=3D"def-box">
      <strong>Definition:</strong> A trace table records the value of each =
variable at each step of an algorithm's execution. It helps you <strong>man=
ually simulate</strong> a computer running code =E2=80=94 catching bugs, ve=
rifying logic, and understanding program flow.
    </div>

    <div class=3D"card-grid">
      <div class=3D"card cyan fade-in visible">
        <div class=3D"card-icon">=F0=9F=93=8B</div>
        <h3>What it Contains</h3>
        <p>Columns for each <span class=3D"hl">variable</span>, plus option=
al columns for output and conditions. Each row represents a step in executi=
on.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card orange fade-in visible">
        <div class=3D"card-icon">=F0=9F=94=8D</div>
        <h3>Why We Use It</h3>
        <p>To <span class=3D"hl2">debug code</span>, verify algorithm corre=
ctness, predict outputs, and answer IGCSE exam questions about algorithm be=
haviour.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card purple fade-in visible">
        <div class=3D"card-icon">=F0=9F=93=9D</div>
        <h3>IGCSE Exam Skill</h3>
        <p>Trace table questions appear in <span class=3D"hl3">Paper 2</spa=
n> and require you to complete tables or identify errors in given pseudocod=
e.</p>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"card green fade-in visible">
        <div class=3D"card-icon">=E2=9A=99=EF=B8=8F</div>
        <h3>When to Use</h3>
        <p>Any algorithm with <span style=3D"color:var(--green); font-weigh=
t:600;">loops, conditions, or multiple variables</span> changing value bene=
fits from a trace table.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOW TO MAKE ONE -->
    <div class=3D"fade-in visible">
      <h3 style=3D"font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:1.5rem; color:var(--text=
);">=F0=9F=9B=A0=EF=B8=8F How to Construct a Trace Table</h3>
      <div class=3D"card-grid" style=3D"grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-=
fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));">
        <div class=3D"card cyan" style=3D"padding:1.25rem;">
          <div style=3D"font-family:var(--display); font-size:3rem; color:v=
ar(--accent); line-height:1;">01</div>
          <h3 style=3D"margin-top:0.5rem;">Identify Variables</h3>
          <p>List every variable that appears in the algorithm. Each gets i=
ts own column.</p>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card orange" style=3D"padding:1.25rem;">
          <div style=3D"font-family:var(--display); font-size:3rem; color:v=
ar(--accent2); line-height:1;">02</div>
          <h3 style=3D"margin-top:0.5rem;">Add Output Column</h3>
          <p>If the algorithm has OUTPUT/PRINT statements, add an OUTPUT co=
lumn on the right.</p>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card purple" style=3D"padding:1.25rem;">
          <div style=3D"font-family:var(--display); font-size:3rem; color:v=
ar(--accent3); line-height:1;">03</div>
          <h3 style=3D"margin-top:0.5rem;">Add Condition Column</h3>
          <p>For loops and IF statements, add a condition column showing TR=
UE or FALSE.</p>
        </div>
        <div class=3D"card green" style=3D"padding:1.25rem;">
          <div style=3D"font-family:var(--display); font-size:3rem; color:v=
ar(--green); line-height:1;">04</div>
          <h3 style=3D"margin-top:0.5rem;">Execute Line by Line</h3>
          <p>Go through each line in order. Fill in the NEW value of any va=
riable that changes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class=3D"divider"></div>

<!-- =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D EXAMPLES =
=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D -->
<section id=3D"examples">
  <div class=3D"section-label">02 =C2=B7 Worked Examples</div>
  <h2 class=3D"section-title">Let's Trace<br>Together</h2>
  <p class=3D"section-desc">Follow these step-by-step worked examples. Each=
 shows the pseudocode alongside its completed trace table.</p>

  <!-- EXAMPLE 1: Simple Assignment -->
  <div class=3D"fade-in visible" style=3D"margin-bottom:3rem;">
    <h3 style=3D"font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--accent2); margin-bottom:0.5r=
em; font-family:var(--mono);">// EXAMPLE 1 =E2=80=94 Simple Assignments &am=
p; Arithmetic</h3>
    <div class=3D"code-block">
      <div class=3D"code-header">
        <div class=3D"code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></d=
iv>
        <span class=3D"code-lang">PSEUDOCODE</span>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"code-body">
<span class=3D"var">x</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span clas=
s=3D"num">5</span><br>
<span class=3D"var">y</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span clas=
s=3D"num">3</span><br>
<span class=3D"var">z</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span clas=
s=3D"var">x</span> <span class=3D"op">+</span> <span class=3D"var">y</span>=
<br>
<span class=3D"var">x</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span clas=
s=3D"var">z</span> <span class=3D"op">*</span> <span class=3D"num">2</span>=
<br>
<span class=3D"kw">OUTPUT</span> <span class=3D"var">x</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p style=3D"color:var(--text-dim); margin-bottom:1rem; font-size:0.9rem=
;">Each time a variable changes, we record its new value in the table. Unch=
anged variables leave the cell empty for that row.</p>

    <div class=3D"trace-container">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>LINE</th>
            <th>x</th>
            <th>y</th>
            <th>z</th>
            <th>OUTPUT</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>1</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">5</td><td class=3D"emp=
ty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"=
empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D=
"highlight-cell">3</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"=
empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D=
"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">8</td><td class=3D"=
empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">16</td><td class=3D"em=
pty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D=
"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr class=3D"highlight-row"><td>5</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=
=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cel=
l">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">16</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"def-box" style=3D"border-color:var(--green);">
      <strong>=F0=9F=93=8C Key Point:</strong> Only fill in a cell when a v=
ariable's value <strong>changes</strong>. If it stays the same, leave that =
cell blank. At line 4, x becomes z=C3=972 =3D 8=C3=972 =3D <strong>16</stro=
ng>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EXAMPLE 2: WHILE loop -->
  <div class=3D"fade-in visible" style=3D"margin-bottom:3rem;">
    <h3 style=3D"font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--accent2); margin-bottom:0.5r=
em; font-family:var(--mono);">// EXAMPLE 2 =E2=80=94 WHILE Loop</h3>
    <div class=3D"code-block">
      <div class=3D"code-header">
        <div class=3D"code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></d=
iv>
        <span class=3D"code-lang">PSEUDOCODE</span>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"code-body">
<span class=3D"var">count</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span =
class=3D"num">1</span><br>
<span class=3D"var">total</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span =
class=3D"num">0</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">WHILE</span> <span class=3D"var">count</span> <span clas=
s=3D"op">&lt;=3D</span> <span class=3D"num">4</span> <span class=3D"kw">DO<=
/span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=3D"var">total</span> <span class=3D"op"=
>=E2=86=90</span> <span class=3D"var">total</span> <span class=3D"op">+</sp=
an> <span class=3D"var">count</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=3D"var">count</span> <span class=3D"op"=
>=E2=86=90</span> <span class=3D"var">count</span> <span class=3D"op">+</sp=
an> <span class=3D"num">1</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">ENDWHILE</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">OUTPUT</span> <span class=3D"var">total</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"trace-container">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>ITERATION</th>
            <th>count</th>
            <th>total</th>
            <th>count &lt;=3D 4</th>
            <th>OUTPUT</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Start</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">1</td><td class=3D=
"highlight-cell">0</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"=
empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Check 1</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td cl=
ass=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"true-cell">TRUE</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Loop 1</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">2</td><td class=
=3D"highlight-cell">1</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Check 2</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td cl=
ass=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"true-cell">TRUE</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Loop 2</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">3</td><td class=
=3D"highlight-cell">3</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Check 3</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td cl=
ass=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"true-cell">TRUE</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Loop 3</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">4</td><td class=
=3D"highlight-cell">6</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Check 4</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td cl=
ass=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"true-cell">TRUE</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Loop 4</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">5</td><td class=
=3D"highlight-cell">10</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=
=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Check 5</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td cl=
ass=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"false-cell">FALSE</td><td cla=
ss=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr class=3D"highlight-row"><td>Output</td><td class=3D"empty-cel=
l">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-=
cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">10</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"def-box" style=3D"border-color:var(--yellow);">
      <strong>=F0=9F=93=8C Key Point:</strong> Always check the condition <=
strong>before</strong> each loop iteration. When count becomes 5, the condi=
tion 5&lt;=3D4 is <strong>FALSE</strong>, so the loop ends. total =3D 1+2+3=
+4 =3D <strong>10</strong>.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- EXAMPLE 3: IF / ELSE -->
  <div class=3D"fade-in visible" style=3D"margin-bottom:3rem;">
    <h3 style=3D"font-size:1.2rem; color:var(--accent2); margin-bottom:0.5r=
em; font-family:var(--mono);">// EXAMPLE 3 =E2=80=94 IF / ELSE Condition</h=
3>
    <div class=3D"code-block">
      <div class=3D"code-header">
        <div class=3D"code-dots"><span></span><span></span><span></span></d=
iv>
        <span class=3D"code-lang">PSEUDOCODE</span>
      </div>
      <div class=3D"code-body">
<span class=3D"var">score</span> <span class=3D"op">=E2=86=90</span> <span =
class=3D"num">72</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">IF</span> <span class=3D"var">score</span> <span class=
=3D"op">&gt;=3D</span> <span class=3D"num">80</span> <span class=3D"kw">THE=
N</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=3D"kw">OUTPUT</span> <span class=3D"str=
">"Distinction"</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">ELSE IF</span> <span class=3D"var">score</span> <span cl=
ass=3D"op">&gt;=3D</span> <span class=3D"num">60</span> <span class=3D"kw">=
THEN</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=3D"kw">OUTPUT</span> <span class=3D"str=
">"Merit"</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">ELSE</span><br>
&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span class=3D"kw">OUTPUT</span> <span class=3D"str=
">"Pass"</span><br>
<span class=3D"kw">ENDIF</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class=3D"trace-container">
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>LINE</th>
            <th>score</th>
            <th>score &gt;=3D 80</th>
            <th>score &gt;=3D 60</th>
            <th>OUTPUT</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>1</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">72</td><td class=3D"em=
pty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D=
"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D=
"false-cell">FALSE</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"=
empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr><td>4</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D=
"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"true-cell">TRUE</td><td class=3D"em=
pty-cell">=E2=80=94</td></tr>
          <tr class=3D"highlight-row"><td>5</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=
=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cell">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"empty-cel=
l">=E2=80=94</td><td class=3D"highlight-cell">"Merit"</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <div class=3D"def-box" style=3D"border-color:var(--accent3);">
      <strong>=F0=9F=93=8C Key Point:</strong> For IF-ELSE chains, only the=
 <strong>first true</strong> branch executes. Since score=3D72 fails the fi=
rst check (72=E2=89=A580 is FALSE) but passes the second (72=E2=89=A560 is =
TRUE), we output "Merit" and skip the rest.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class=3D"divider"></div>

<!-- =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D INTERACTI=
VE ANIMATOR =3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D=3D --=
